      ('What is the most popular wedding venue in Victoria BC?', 'Hatley Castle, The Butchart Gardens and the Fairmont Empress are among the best known, but "best" depends on your guest count, season and style. Smaller couples often love Abkhazi Garden or a park ceremony.'),
